  "description": "The entire world suddenly falls into a deep, mysterious slumber, leaving Yujin as the only person awake in a frozen reality. Terrified and alone, she seeks out her childhood friend, Hyeonwu. When she finds his door open, she discovers him fast asleep - but fully aroused. Overwhelmed by a sudden, irresistible wave of desire, Yujin gives in to temptation. But the moment pleasure peaks, Hyeonwu suddenly snaps awake. In a world where time has stopped, an unpredictable and seductive game has just begun.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
